{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1254,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274df7646eadc61bd0e0fb00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔，训练……\r\n好啦，那就来做吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bbbee9f32fed235aba6e40d587b720ac7d3fec4c16a1c27612cc036cd02e7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541065076b37d25fc977681a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我们还是来去钓鱼吧，\r\n钓鱼～",
      "source_fingerprint": "071b28100ee5713fd4fc27de65680ac64c7cbaffbcf18d11a33476529abd1df6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8e998bce5db8286ff610760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——毕竟你的对象是我嘛，\r\n觉得我会认真做训练……\r\n可别对我有这种过高的期待哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebbd56d595d1ac8ace1fa99b5b4aa06323c508200f6b7b320eab51b9e6bafece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d1e58845182cd4da529f6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我们真的要做训练吗——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b40067ea705464b44f0ca4cb7a543c82c8961e50989b13f4eec5ecd05e56fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c35cfd638c0b265dcc3cda8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊——不行了，我一步也不想动了。\r\n能做到这种程度，\r\n可以称赞我了吧——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d946bcc164f9297b8da8fa1592e061b91f36f7578d4ad75ca7f833a834b2605f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a95552bf1bb065ca6e0f042",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯——比赛哦——\r\n但我好像有点累了耶——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02e3a36990d49467e31e83ad981ee29161d1e30dc92c65872b2a090fc62efed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b45edacb54db5ee6186bbad0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直在比赛的话，\r\n不就什么对策都做不出来了吗？\r\n……我只是说说看而已啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a12921a634291a76eda5580a243722a4964d80b214fb72753b604904dc7f6e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b751d6ac677b7fc3f691ac50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，呵，呵——\r\n就让你看看我的青云之志吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83af198d2f844007f67a21353903083713d14d0a463bdc6e58bfd951c6a62bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87102b627bae7c1ef29af997",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作战名称就叫“努力要适当”。\r\n我们就诱使别人大意来取胜吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ee1638ded0ffc568ab575214707dad8707d991dea6796470f0500eadaf94db6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a457ee8d7a46e30f29cc7864",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早就都已经准备好咯。\r\n那我们就来去钓大鱼吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64f4a8ca2fde3a5e3932f62adbbb825fba401709856ed8db6c6237d91cf12fde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80e48916c10f4a58947c0012",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是常说别给自己太多压力吗？\r\n所以啦，\r\n就照平常的样子就好……嘻嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb6b84b9053b16299f08f15a381c7989ee2ee767cf3036e9b9e804825364e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99868bf6ab8edd7b72b9218d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦——\r\n就在比赛开始前\r\n来做做准备好了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "736f97c07fe222fe2163caf0f9a85e08275cfd125794a1dc4979a6020dbb7096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9117a7060a3666ed57b25a5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯——我想想——\r\n如果只是一点点的话，\r\n也可以对我抱有期待哦——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1da81d0615940607fc1d3ea61185fbf5c8dbaac2a97eca26d8e59f17f8177b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca0ca58290c79afbddcff39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就去随性地跑一下咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "86dbcf9a79ab06b2165a943cb90bf2c2b2dac4e511c3d83880098e649bff8852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f27478724aa6360e4334b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人生就是普普通通才恰到好处嘛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "266a97e4a40dc9674e1289b7d0a8e313ea432769d203cf9d83b532c2cd540df3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1c48d7f0645067ba046f8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之我会适当地努力的啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "952d789460699ded2230f76652c89b416aa2b8b3806a82617f7ae74c3d8a291b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8924334dca32052364140814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算知道自己比不过人家——\r\n也没打算要随便输的意思啊——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb4e7710802bde07c83c0ccb7d77d0301815769217b7eb799ee7b87b8ea400a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa8a31cc817365a31c402f24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不是绝佳的状态，\r\n但我还是有做好一些\r\n自己的事前准备啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "61171eeab0384fbaf327bc9f6c690941fe2d8ab804ddbced7c95c57354a8f6d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef0e14117920fcf4945d7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇——比赛就快开始啦……\r\n但既然都来到这里了，\r\n就也只能好好面对咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e5be41516ff739ad6e2786b0b5a03262200a7bc1e8cc0b27b56462da2b50be8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e4f0b36251ea09bbb90fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正也不是现在做点什么，\r\n就会有什么改变的嘛。\r\n我就照自己的步调去跑咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbbd4d90cffc40f3f433c90d43e5d54241aa9e65a2b63d4aa0cbcc6e65db822f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ded3d1b56f4e25c26a40546",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀～全都是看起来很强的对手啊——\r\n……但这时候要是我拿第一名，\r\n应该会非常有趣吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80b6bfdd5e794c9923f9182a96058d9f518540e46aaa6318b0e346a7fb12765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6c35a4f88c3f04f4779bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了是侥幸，\r\n输了也不意外——\r\n反正就是这种感觉啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94f989dce63673480b3e7ce65cd2269e438fe05763681b35d3ac6098123ee85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:700e77503b4025547dffb2ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦好啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "87331471ea174ed609328d3734d09672ad5f6cbbfe121e90863d9be860efd79a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67282e439a107609839e1c50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6324edda6c0127822d0c6c7280df2195aac8d03a7209aca19cffadf07af136c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a213ddae1f2b33b50df1ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc4454c60512bed243b77f94b93c108f91cfff67c3ad2cc0c03423dc56ab9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02130cfdd280f9153fc5934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "念书啊——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ef9449f6aad2b4ea6495c5a591e62e60067782cae36d356894619f60bee147",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e44f2f014a71aea7b16da61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76014ef2aeef544b738755476c882c6c6e25c9ddc35e8df33bc4304ac1f8509f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7110d1f619ddb0a4f8877d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cec7a36e298493f1d75ff08e31f1d96512331979e25650ca56d116ea35db8da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bccf99e47fd686200bb71da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就走吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f5c09f8dc755f5d8409da8172e0bea880adb1d819209045107155827320d638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400492832cac00dd4d96dfe4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海边耶——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8d8412fc0243b674c10b58990b44b61201e494aef4f8774946a9fee8bf2692a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f11bcd09f9bbad5c00c4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2beb165cd1c2c79460a3ccf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我来说算是非常努力了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94cbef8930838996495396bafc5d5e2239a90095a2db25b2a1294d2eb314f84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9baa931778ed2e96f26765f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好你好——请多指教哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533ac0d4ed40b3ce461324eaa03e1860daee3ab092262e0205c64eca6716bb55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3407238008072da8b0ff046c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96441a321db55e3e5b8eb19cf1f36a61d6fc16261e9eb4346e00b1bdd3cd9e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:498e8f50e59aa0a063659b05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，各位，轮到我们上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5056dc3864ced4d551d248e211d3180b3fb65b1020bce9ed50503e9fac66d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2174c080a0e28a9aae34a79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3747f806cb348a1625fbf901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯——我想想——\r\n如果只是一点点的话，\r\n也可以对我抱有期待哦——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1da81d0615940607fc1d3ea61185fbf5c8dbaac2a97eca26d8e59f17f8177b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ce655ddd2c1a5c138e7d84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早就都已经准备好咯。\r\n那我们就来去钓大鱼吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64f4a8ca2fde3a5e3932f62adbbb825fba401709856ed8db6c6237d91cf12fde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed1870ac13ab49b3f8829a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0c3c7dbefbd8e8648ef3b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほいほーい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4e70ab74dbbfd458210d0723cdd7fe7676c9f7814b83f396ce91504b5bb7c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167eadb9004bb1aeeb1bbbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得好，做得好——♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4129c2ff8c874d2ca42241807a84bebdff0831db79f5fccc2c4666ca6b84cda8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021d981f99b10e118d0d6e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之就当作肯做就能做到咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2541da30bdeb218550fa26fe52d909c34ed929bb816d8ae9d92e58c4883541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4303ed47375291a6dd074d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该算是还可以吧——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1697186fce25e8b9f1a7a7e15d58904a581fac34f28144bc7b9874799d7552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:494f5f75cba28b17744f4354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——没能成功啊——啊哈哈——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6548aec511ac6cd36202d4731a55096a7a422c1b8d251e99f268c36718bca7ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:423ee4cbf6efb3a6e7a61907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多么令人满意的结果啊……哦哆！？唔～呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e41752b38e9f5bb9d331405a928d9bee5cd0acd3946a88e99a706ff21da1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7bbf40075438cf43594a04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声好像……比预期的还要大？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb803de3dc77b1e7465239ae4d64dabd447604944db615febefa205c857e344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dce692e296c0204873b5ef3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将这场胜利献给你。\r\n……不是骗你的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f92bbe4bbf9d7cf9166c95e9c9a1947b9578540c9bc402c9e0e475e27498027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72b32844819b05eda9b28a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比预料之中还要响亮的欢呼声……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2b77b7140a63e4ab759cab7ea972525fb4b38ef0d8d4ca6f0ddd68822bf86c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36550c8ac919438c36c9014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就上场咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb0e49dd6813c30355fecd6d3b3398c2d77cf59aedcd70d9545136f9b749da0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b980b5dfb04a7a88847909c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……来了！就是现在——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373f6d6af1d9ff5dca8520f20a268b049ba3045550d082ea34b6408feba9b930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab398f3f1d9d746f618232ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "富士同学吗……她每次来美浦宿舍的时候，\r\n我们都会猜谁又会被她迷住。亚马逊同学嘛……\r\n倒是感觉她一直在生气来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfc3d53598684d94749088b4569701a38054921a14e1a4fc7c033d8913dcd5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0c5cd7014ede6a911b9bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～……那个啊。所谓的幸福，\r\n说不定指的就是睡到午后吧。\r\n好啦，今天的饭会是什么呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d0b76168ddce71a34fc282a012f9f3b1c72ec9e2152d7200551e3d8bddd80eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1cd936b7b2d35feb999d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知ってるよ、キングが諦め悪いって\r\nことくらい。対策、さんざん\r\n苦労させられたんだからさ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3164db88fb493d7e3f8b4891d423d2efaf8451fdb9fe2043d48375ebb090cd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b558aa228bb61f1afacf7570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前在比赛里输掉……之后就\r\n沉迷上钓鱼了来着。那时候的\r\n冠军――爷爷真的好强啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd9e03849e31ce72350bad6c58ae33703c34a4edbb5203d8850e80a802d9994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c83b6a1b84737175ea15805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青酱是这么想的……要是大家，\r\n都能像我这样生活就好了。\r\n虽然那样世道可就要乱套了呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d41206410cb1a2c92501681833464f10829e0fb663ee827b6d35a21cc0f8992",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e565a8ac64a5781fa55f0729",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～嘶呼……嗯！大鱼来了～！\r\n……呀哈，上当了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b2dd8776e0afd52148115257a26e8142a1b17e4862145a9ccdf13ddd581258",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f5746c56d9bd5e25a15d2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次虽然只是一场表演而已……\r\n但总有一天，我会将真正的——\r\n什么的，试着说了一下～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fc8098e5e18e68bef0ae60d14a547bf12bf5092faca1ce783d8a1c43aa1b54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879aee92f6b360c29ce818bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，累死了……\r\n让我们和美丽的花儿一起嬉戏，\r\n然后获得治愈吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8992c4d621ca775ed33f6edab89ccc5b7379c56be6d5aa10fd86158028d12202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd6995d99b3cab048e1d90f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就乘上这股风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2ccb41c493f0111591d91f8b3aec4e3446cc2584f07bd537b85d052a8f48293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c58d895375545d50556c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没劲啊……才怪☆\r\nIt's show time！……吓了一跳吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea4155b62e99646ca068b688b0cb31b3c52aa456e79e41156863be0dee1ce00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:540e671cc491acac2d4e921d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くぁ…っ。早起きでねむ～～。\r\n――甲板の端っこで、\r\nお昼寝しちゃダメかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2417f7daace9ce26133572bf7e6d66aa5b35c142043decb2577c55c654840c44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9e68e2a9894bfdfa5705f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あんなに堂々とされたら\r\nみんな認めるしかないんじゃない？\r\n…かっこよかったよ、キング。",
      "source_fingerprint": "469d99698f0c99bd0824ac025a5c2aebaf4f28842c86a7372697cad61ce8775a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "400080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:200ca4e86a2cb8e478711dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c87dc39f67e8774041ff4f0c5da95bb2529cec51d206eb8280c05d02c5aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59b05fc5f4dcba46fec6d724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee327d3092c4afc6b71659ccfc729029aef99544817e688ab1fa87c873e2d321",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46bbe4040fa689d795a4f693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀哈哈——",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f0f02e2f7841d29d7e7f75bccd3cf24118e01407f5995eb8426554eff86828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26da40b6030957a8b3702371",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀哈哈——",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f0f02e2f7841d29d7e7f75bccd3cf24118e01407f5995eb8426554eff86828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab43f94779bdb7be61b1352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0212cb1ec9201ff17e6acf0ea2d70e06cf290b6bc356f0e84aed5329a8a9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54454690d3352c73dc823fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0212cb1ec9201ff17e6acf0ea2d70e06cf290b6bc356f0e84aed5329a8a9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525c307cd856714abe9b339f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f54137d60e821b7cae09b47fa2e665f5be43a1b8519738aecd59be7a101532f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e657fc83ead65e1c657ff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f54137d60e821b7cae09b47fa2e665f5be43a1b8519738aecd59be7a101532f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d74f8e52e041075314e6a90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f54137d60e821b7cae09b47fa2e665f5be43a1b8519738aecd59be7a101532f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350af17cb99dd5d72747b8fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿——\r\n这时候就该热闹起来才对哦——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4f7c4f3f7eabf3756aca98452bed8a93cb07467e841f4c8beed20e526c9b78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b064114ecc3015d6b2411d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就来去唱一下吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cbd174ca68982dae9c1c8c5c3c3f5d4f2bbe319b71781a09c43cfb409630d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f59f9bf3820e64fe59cbab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起轻～松度过吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3c482c9cf2b7110fbabadf4675b973d28aad0cf2ba6842a96b904dafa624a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93379f709f45259293c4f326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很久很久以前，\r\n某个新人训练员和赛马娘……\r\n哎呀？讲这太多余了是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd0ea0482217f2581d4341668cf3813d3134df0fe9a7c3bb0141229ed2268ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e1841ce809011cc9e47a11f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用烦恼每天要穿什么！\r\n制服最棒了——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b53d32ee66057324b7fe9989d1d770c3f9f29335d2616489ff72f8eb67cfc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c8e41df121d2279789d629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑完还要演唱会……其实很辛苦的耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a0e4a5503e46ba4dda7f2b73b9f8662486a95808f4ab9e6d6d8f0459d479ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d13d4f803fb3fd5681835a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我最棒的衣服哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7408fb5dfb9c0bd1fd04f281dddfb48eaf7ac1a9c81b065323a9f73a2e3790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e52159ff1f94634e6f98fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？我没有穿反吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "878863a76ffdb3d73e9305f9e52e476baeb6e8b6bb63b7c66f4a5dcf50d14d1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db0ef0d4f609159781b1979c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青酱我可爱吗？呀☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec54abfc2245c86ecb518cd8e267e1d6deeca343a563638afd031433d3f041f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
